'''Uberfest''' (超ネコ祭 Chō neko-sai, '''Ultra Cat Festival''') is one of the [[:Category:Gacha Event|Gacha events]] in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 3.6 Update|Version 3.6]]. This event includes all [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] from every common pool and from [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] onwards, and [[Baby Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|an exclusive character]]. [[Miko Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|The second exclusive cat]] was added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]], the [[D'artanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|third]] was added in [[Version 6.7 Update|Version 6.7]], the [[Kasli the Scourge (Uber Rare Cat)|fourth]] was added in [[Version 9.2 Update|Version 9.2]], the [[Baby Garu (Uber Rare Cat)|fifth]] was added in [[Version 10.1 Update|Version 10.1]], the [[Iz the Dancer (Uber Rare Cat)|sixth]] was added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]], the [[Child of Destiny Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|seventh]] was added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]], the [[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|eighth]] was added in [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]], and the [[Squire Luno (Uber Rare Cat)|ninth]] was added in [[Version 15.1 Update|Version 15.1]].

