==Trivia==
*In The Battle Cats Unite, it is the first banner to be outright removed in the game via an [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Update History#Live Download Patch (September 14, 2023)|update]] and is replaced with a different one, in this case it is replaced with [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)|SUPERFEST]] in the JP Version.
*Curiously, the first forms of the exclusive units in this banner (Except for [[Daybreaker Izanagi (Legend Rare Cat)|Izanagi]] and [[Iz the Dancer (Uber Rare Cat)|Iz the Dancer]]) seem to be younger than their evolved forms. Unlike the [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] units, who seem to be adults in both forms.

